       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ZPR2P.
      * Prints the data of its START.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-DATA   PIC X(20).
       01 WS-LEN    PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 20.
       01 WS-CODE   PIC X(2).
       01 WS-LINE.
          05 FILLER PIC X(6) VALUE 'ZPR2: '.
          05 WS-TEXT PIC X(20).
          05 FILLER PIC X(1) VALUE SPACE.
          05 WS-SC  PIC X(2).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           EXEC CICS RETRIEVE INTO(WS-DATA) LENGTH(WS-LEN) END-EXEC
           EXEC CICS ASSIGN STARTCODE(WS-CODE) END-EXEC
           MOVE WS-DATA TO WS-TEXT
           MOVE WS-CODE TO WS-SC
           EXEC CICS SEND TEXT FROM(WS-LINE) LENGTH(29) ERASE PRINT
           END-EXEC
           EXEC CICS RETURN END-EXEC.
